3 March</span> 2010</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=Linux+Online+%E2%80%93+Linus+Torvalds+Bio&amp;rft.pub=Linux.org&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.linux.org%2Finfo%2Flinus.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ALinus+Torvalds" class="Z3988" about="#mwt82" id="mwA_g"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-Rogoway-26" id="cite_note-Rogoway-26" data-mw-footnote-number="25"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwA_k"><a href="#cite_ref-Rogoway_26-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwA_o" aria-label="Jump up" title="Jump up"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwA_s">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-Rogoway-26" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt85" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwA_w" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;cite news &quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Cite_news&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;url&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;https://www.oregonlive.com/business/2005/06/linus_torvalds_incognito_inven.html&quot;},&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Linus Torvalds, Incognito Inventor&quot;},&quot;first&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Mike&quot;},&quot;last&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Rogoway&quot;},&quot;newspaper&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;[[The Oregonian]]&quot;},&quot;date&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;7 June 2005&quot;},&quot;access-date&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;8 July 2014&quot;},&quot;quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;A sort of anti-celebrity, he is plainly ambivalent about fame and content to stay nestled at home in a tony cluster of million-dollar houses atop the densely forested hills of the Dunthorpe neighborhood.&quot;},&quot;archive-date&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;17 September 2019&quot;},&quot;archive-url&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;https://web.archive.org/web/20190917005208/https://www.oregonlive.com/business/2005/06/linus_torvalds_incognito_inven.html&quot;},&quot;url-status&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;live&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFRogoway2005" class="citation news cs1" about="#mwt85">Rogoway, Mike (7 June 2005). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.oregonlive.com/business/2005/06/linus_torvalds_incognito_inven.html" class="external text" id="mwA_0">"Linus Torvalds, Incognito Inventor"</a>. <i id="mwA_4"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Oregonian" title="The Oregonian" id="mwA_8">The Oregonian</a></i>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20190917005208/https://www.oregonlive.com/business/2005/06/linus_torvalds_incognito_inven.html" class="external text" id="mwBAA">Archived</a> from the original on 17 September 2019<span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwBAE">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwBAI">8 July</span> 2014</span>. <q id="mwBAM">A sort of anti-celebrity, he is plainly ambivalent about fame and content to stay nestled at home in a tony cluster of million-dollar houses atop the densely forested hills of the Dunthorpe neighborhood.</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Oregonian&amp;rft.atitle=Linus+Torvalds%2C+Incognito+Inventor&amp;rft.date=2005-06-07&amp;rft.aulast=Rogoway&amp;rft.aufirst=Mike&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.oregonlive.com%2Fbusiness%2F2005%2F06%2Flinus_torvalds_incognito_inven.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ALinus+Torvalds" class="Z3988" about="#mwt85" id="mwBAQ"></span></span></li>
